data
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
services/*/.next
# `next build` runs inside the image now, so anything in the build context that
# Next loads at build time reaches the bundle. A stray .env would have its
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* inlined — silently overriding the build args that are supposed
# to be the only source for them — and would ship in an image layer besides.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
